WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.278
This structured table is easy to scan because every
row follows the same columns But

00:00:06.304 --> 00:00:11.916
the columns do not all have the same analytical
meaning Patient ID

00:00:11.942 --> 00:00:17.563
and ZIP code are labels Date of birth is temporal
Sex and blood

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:23.138
type are categorical This is a useful example of the
distinction

00:00:23.164 --> 00:00:28.732
between dataset organization and variable meaning
The dataset is

00:00:28.745 --> 00:00:32.495
structured but each variable still needs its own
classification
